msgid "Your search index needs rebuilding before it matches how this version indexes content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:220
msgid "Version 0.8.2 was too strict about which PDFs it would index: it required the WordPress attachment relationship, which is only set for files uploaded from inside the post editor. PDFs added through the Media Library were skipped even when published pages linked to them. This release fixes that, and your \"Which PDFs\" setting has been moved to the corrected option."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:226
msgid "This version also stops password-protected posts being indexed. Content indexed by an earlier version is still present and still searchable until you rebuild."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:232
msgid "Earlier versions joined words across line breaks when reading many PDFs, so a phrase like \"common questions\" was stored as \"commonquestions\" wherever a line wrapped, and neither word could be found there. Rebuilding fixes that, and lets PDF results highlight the matching words."
msgstr ""

